<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[14px] text-primary">water</span> Réserve Naturelle Étang Saint-Paul
                  </span>
<span class="px-2.5 py-1 bg-surface-container-lowest/95 rounded-full shadow text-on-surface text-label-sm font-label-sm flex items-center gap-1 hover:bg-secondary-container transition-colors cursor-pointer">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[14px] text-primary">phishing</span> Kélonia (Observatoire Tortues)
                  </span>
<span class="px-2.5 py-1 bg-surface-container-lowest/95 rounded-full shadow text-on-surface text-label-sm font-label-sm flex items-center gap-1 hover:bg-secondary-container transition-colors cursor-pointer">
